# An everyday algorithm: make a cup of tea. Render: tools/diagrams.sh
...@_style
direction: right

a: "1. Boil water" {class: step}
b: "2. Put a tea bag\nin the cup" {class: step}
c: "3. Pour the water" {class: step}
d: "Strong enough?" {class: ask}
w: "Wait 1 minute" {class: note}
e: "4. Remove the bag" {class: end}
a -> b -> c -> d
d -> e: yes
d -> w: no
w -> d
